        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gulls of Doom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle endless waves of aggressive seagulls as a scrappy raccoon or rat in this fast-paced roguelite arena combat game. Perfect for quick sessions alone or chaotic couch co-op with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5-Minute Rounds</strong> - Quick, addictive gameplay loops perfect for &quot;just one more round&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric Co-op</strong> - Team up with a friend where one wields melee weapons while the other provides ranged support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Unlockable Weapons</strong> - Earn points to unlock 5 melee and 5 ranged weapons across multiple runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Together</strong> - In co-op, both players must collect enough gull beaks to unlock character upgrades, encouraging teamwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique builds</strong> - Every run you have to decide which upgrade trees you want to focus on, which ones are just supporting, endless build fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Chaos</strong> - Face increasingly challenging waves of different seagull types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick-up-and-Play</strong> - Simple controls, deep strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your turf from the feathered menace. Collect beaks. Upgrade your arsenal. Survive the swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're going solo or bringing a buddy, every round brings new challenges and that irresistible urge to try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note:  requires controllers</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gulls of Doom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle endless waves of aggressive seagulls as a scrappy raccoon or rat in this fast-paced roguelite arena combat game. Perfect for quick sessions alone or chaotic couch co-op with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5-Minute Rounds</strong> - Quick, addictive gameplay loops perfect for &quot;just one more round&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric Co-op</strong> - Team up with a friend where one wields melee weapons while the other provides ranged support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Unlockable Weapons</strong> - Earn points to unlock 5 melee and 5 ranged weapons across multiple runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Together</strong> - In co-op, both players must collect enough gull beaks to unlock character upgrades, encouraging teamwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique builds</strong> - Every run you have to decide which upgrade trees you want to focus on, which ones are just supporting, endless build fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Chaos</strong> - Face increasingly challenging waves of different seagull types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick-up-and-Play</strong> - Simple controls, deep strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your turf from the feathered menace. Collect beaks. Upgrade your arsenal. Survive the swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're going solo or bringing a buddy, every round brings new challenges and that irresistible urge to try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note:  requires controllers</i></p>",
